==================================================

Implement:

POST /api/patients

Authentication:
- JWT required

Authorization:
- DOCTOR allowed
- STUDENT allowed
- PATIENT not allowed

Request example:

{
  "name": "Anil Kumar",
  "date_of_birth": "2001-05-15",
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

Validation:

- name required
- name should not be empty
- date_of_birth optional if existing model allows nullable
- gender optional if existing model allows nullable
- phone optional if existing model allows nullable
- validate reasonable field lengths/types
- reject malformed input with HTTP 400/422 according to existing project conventions

The authenticated user's ID must be used for:

created_by

DO NOT allow the client to submit an arbitrary created_by user ID.

Response should return the created patient.

