==================================================

Before creating an assessment:

1. Verify authenticated user.
2. Verify user role is DOCTOR or STUDENT.
3. Verify patient exists.
4. Verify authenticated user is allowed to work with that patient according to the existing authorization model.
5. Verify questionnaire_version exists.
6. Create assessment.
7. Set status to IN_PROGRESS.
8. Set started_at appropriately.
9. Return the created assessment.

If patient does not exist:

404

If questionnaire version does not exist:

404

If user is not authorized:

403

If request is invalid:

400/422 according to existing validation conventions.

